# The Mezzanine — line-ending containment
#
# Lock package-lock.json to LF regardless of core.autocrlf on the workstation.
# Pattern 018 Instance 5 (line-ending normalization) — propagated from
# Smokestacks 5c8d508 per Pattern 002 (fix-propagation-across-experiments).

package-lock.json text eol=lf

# Cargo.lock is tracked as of v0.2.5 (see .gitignore note). Pin it to LF too so
# cargo's Windows CRLF rewrites don't surface phantom diffs on every build.
src-tauri/Cargo.lock text eol=lf
